    "Chat history is kept on this device so chats open instantly, even offline, and so you can search your messages. Messages you write offline, with their attachments, wait here until they send.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chat history is kept on this device so chats open instantly, even offline, and so you can search your messages. Messages you write offline, with their attachments, wait here until they send."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聊天历史记录保存在此设备上，因此即使离线，也可以立即打开聊天，以便您可以搜索消息。您离线写的消息及其附件将在此处等待直至发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
