    "Speak Replies on Channels is gateway-wide. It controls when the Gateway attaches spoken audio to replies on channels like Discord or Telegram, for everyone. It doesn't affect Read Aloud in Pincer. To always use this device's own voice for Read Aloud, change the Voice option in Settings → Read Aloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speak Replies on Channels is gateway-wide. It controls when the Gateway attaches spoken audio to replies on channels like Discord or Telegram, for everyone. It doesn't affect Read Aloud in Pincer. To always use this device's own voice for Read Aloud, change the Voice option in Settings → Read Aloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在频道上说出回复是在网关范围内进行的。它控制网关何时将语音音频附加到 Discord 或 Telegram 等频道上的回复中，供所有人使用。它不会影响 Pincer 中的朗读。要始终使用此设备自己的语音进行朗读，请在“设置”→“朗读”中更改“语音”选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
