        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailscale Serve 使用 HTTPS，因此通常应该是 wss://。仅将 ws:// 与 tailnet IP 和网关端口一起使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Listen under a reply, or use Read Last Reply Aloud (its keyboard shortcut) from the command palette. Press Esc or tap the Speaking pill to stop. Automatic uses the Gateway's voice when available. The device voice is used when the Gateway can't provide one. New replies are only read in the chat you're looking at, and not while VoiceOver is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap Listen under a reply, or use Read Last Reply Aloud (its keyboard shortcut) from the command palette. Press Esc or tap the Speaking pill to stop. Automatic uses the Gateway's voice when available. The device voice is used when the Gateway can't provide one. New replies are only read in the chat you're looking at, and not while VoiceOver is on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击回复下的“聆听”，或使用命令面板中的“大声朗读最后回复”（其键盘快捷键）。按 Esc 或点击语音丸即可停止。自动使用网关的语音（如果可用）。当网关无法提供设备语音时，使用设备语音。新回复只能在您正在查看的聊天中读取，而不会在 VoiceOver 开启时读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a shortcut, then press the new keys. Press Delete to remove it, or Esc to cancel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a shortcut, then press the new keys. Press Delete to remove it, or Esc to cancel."
