    "When enabled, Pincer shares a recent device location as context for the agent, separate from your message text. The Gateway may retain this context in chat history. Reported accuracy comes from the device and may be reduced by system privacy settings. Pincer requests a one-time fix only while the app is active and sends your message without location if no recent fix is available. Commands do not include location. Turning this off stops future captures; queued messages keep the context captured when they were sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, Pincer shares a recent device location as context for the agent, separate from your message text. The Gateway may retain this context in chat history. Reported accuracy comes from the device and may be reduced by system privacy settings. Pincer requests a one-time fix only while the app is active and sends your message without location if no recent fix is available. Commands do not include location. Turning this off stops future captures; queued messages keep the context captured when they were sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，Pincher 将共享最近的设备位置作为代理的上下文，与您的消息文本分开。网关可以在聊天历史中保留该上下文。报告的准确性来自设备，可能会因系统隐私设置而降低。 Pincer 仅在应用程序处于活动状态时请求一次性修复，如果最近没有可用的修复，则会发送不带位置的消息。命令不包括位置。关闭此功能会停止以后的捕获；排队的消息保留发送时捕获的上下文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, your speech is recognized on this device and isn't sent to Apple. When off, Apple's servers may be used for languages that don't have an on-device model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, your speech is recognized on this device and isn't sent to Apple. When off, Apple's servers may be used for languages that don't have an on-device model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，您的语音将在此设备上被识别，并且不会发送至 Apple。关闭后，Apple 的服务器可能会用于没有设备上模型的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When someone messages one of these accounts, their request shows up here.": {
